          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>For $99\\%$ confidence, $\\alpha/2 = 0.005$ and $z_{0.005} = 2.58$. Then $n = \\dfrac{z_{\\alpha/2}^2\\,\\hat p(1-\\hat p)}{E^2} = \\dfrac{(2.58)^2(0.08)(0.92)}{(0.04)^2} = \\dfrac{6.6564 \\times 0.0736}{0.0016} = \\dfrac{0.48991}{0.0016} = 306.2$. Sample size is always rounded UP, giving $n = 307$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Với độ tin cậy $99\\%$, $\\alpha/2 = 0{,}005$ và $z_{0.005} = 2{,}58$. Khi đó $n = \\dfrac{z_{\\alpha/2}^2\\,\\hat p(1-\\hat p)}{E^2} = \\dfrac{(2{,}58)^2(0{,}08)(0{,}92)}{(0{,}04)^2} = \\dfrac{6{,}6564 \\times 0{,}0736}{0{,}0016} = 306{,}2$. Cỡ mẫu luôn làm tròn LÊN, nên $n = 307$.</p></div>"
